  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "This ability covers every **ORKS** unit of yours that has it. Such a unit may re-roll its **Advance rolls**, and other rules can make it **riled up**, which gives it:\n\n- a 5+ invulnerable save\n- **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)** on its ranged attacks\n- **advance moves** that do not affect whether it is **eligible to declare a charge**\n\nOnce per battle, your army may use [War Cry](vsdata:ability/orks.war-cry) to make every **ORKS** unit of yours with this ability riled up.",
